### 1. 게시글 등록 - 201
POST http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "첫 번째 게시글",
  "content": "웹서비스설계 과제입니다."
}

### 2. 댓글 등록 - 201
POST http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/posts/1/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "첫 번째 댓글입니다."
}

### 3. 게시글 목록 조회 - 200
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/posts

### 3-1. 게시글 목록 검색 - 200
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/posts?keyword=과제

### 4. 게시글 단건 조회 - 200
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/posts/1

### 5. 게시글 전체 교체 - 200
PUT http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/posts/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "수정된 게시글",
  "content": "수정된 본문입니다."
}

### 6. 댓글 수정 - 200
PUT http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/posts/1/comments/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "수정된 댓글입니다."
}

### 7. 댓글 삭제 - 200
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/posts/1/comments/1

### 8. 게시글 삭제 - 200
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/posts/1

### 400 - 입력 검증 오류
POST http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "content": "본문"
}

### 400 - ID 형식 오류
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/posts/abc

### 404 - 게시글 없음
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/posts/9999

### 500 - 시뮬레이션
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/posts
X-Simulate-Error: 500

### 503 - 시뮬레이션
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/posts
X-Simulate-Error: 503
